# - Mo-Nb-Ta-W (4,983 training and 546 validation configurations, PBE, 520 eV, 4x4x4) and FLiNaK (754 configurations, PBE+D3) MTPs at levels 12-18, the ETN comparison and the base and compressed ACE (FLiNaK) have errors in Figs. 5-10 only; these models are not encoded.
# - FLiNaK densities (Table IV) and glycine polymorph energies (Fig. 11) are properties.
